From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 14:23:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/27] Mobile: Add German translations for the tile view
 strings

The tile view UI strings introduced in this fork were correctly marked
for translation with _() but had no German msgstr, so a de_DE UI still
showed them in English. Add the missing translations to de_DE.po and
rebuild the corresponding runtime locale file with Joplin's own
parsePoFile/parseTranslations toolchain.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0122rnadKkGCFMVkX948oRD8

